# Desk UI

- Positions Unrealized for qty 0 must render **0** even if the API still has stale MTM (`Number(qty)===0`).
- Risk header Halt/Resume tooltips must stay aligned with `tradingEnabled` vs `deskHalted` (Resume turns trading back on).
- Sessions win rate is a fraction; do not silently treat it as rupee `money()` if you change formatting — say 0% / 100% if you relabel.
- After UI or P&L derivation changes, exercise Positions + the other tabs that read the same payload (portfolio chips). If no browser, say so and use API/tests.
